    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy idle cafe management that keeps you company while you work. Grow fresh ingredients, cook, and serve delicious food to adorable animal customers. Build your dream cafe that sits at the bottom of your screen. <strong> </strong> <br><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Fresh Ingredients</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant and harvest crops from your little farm to create the freshest meals.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/727385ad40e9fec84bab7ae73d5c0144.poster.avif?t=1752759542\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/727385ad40e9fec84bab7ae73d5c0144.webm?t=1752759542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/727385ad40e9fec84bab7ae73d5c0144.mp4?t=1752759542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your dream cafe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design, decorate, and customize your perfect cafe to match your unique style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/c9615d3d59b8a5195e45c117fb35bdf9.poster.avif?t=1752759542\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/c9615d3d59b8a5195e45c117fb35bdf9.webm?t=1752759542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/c9615d3d59b8a5195e45c117fb35bdf9.mp4?t=1752759542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cook &amp; Serve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn fresh ingredients into delicious meals and earn money to buy decoration or upgrade your cafe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/bbf2c12587ecda9cc3561f9ed3f01d5d.poster.avif?t=1752759542\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/bbf2c12587ecda9cc3561f9ed3f01d5d.webm?t=1752759542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/bbf2c12587ecda9cc3561f9ed3f01d5d.mp4?t=1752759542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playing while working</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friendly staff will take care of the cafe, keeping things running smoothly while you work, study, or relax.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/c22a21902f37672b7810cc1962a8903b.poster.avif?t=1752759542\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/c22a21902f37672b7810cc1962a8903b.webm?t=1752759542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/c22a21902f37672b7810cc1962a8903b.mp4?t=1752759542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Twitch &amp; Streaming integration</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect to your stream and turn your stream into cozy cafe where chat join  cafe and hangout as customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/d85c9ff652971b4eb21d97c175a898c9.poster.avif?t=1752759542\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/d85c9ff652971b4eb21d97c175a898c9.webm?t=1752759542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/d85c9ff652971b4eb21d97c175a898c9.mp4?t=1752759542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock and upgrade more than 300 recipes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook and serve delicious drinks and dishes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/02fb8bc35e3a6c51c5c0da6f068fb5be.poster.avif?t=1752759542\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/02fb8bc35e3a6c51c5c0da6f068fb5be.apng?t=1752759542\" class=\"bb_img\" width=576 height=324 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Connect with your friends online with Postal Service</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send gifts to your friends. Visit your best friends' cafe.</p>",
