<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cook &amp; Serve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn fresh ingredients into delicious meals and earn money to buy decoration or upgrade your cafe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/bbf2c12587ecda9cc3561f9ed3f01d5d.poster.avif?t=1752759542\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/bbf2c12587ecda9cc3561f9ed3f01d5d.webm?t=1752759542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/bbf2c12587ecda9cc3561f9ed3f01d5d.mp4?t=1752759542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playing while working</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friendly staff will take care of the cafe, keeping things running smoothly while you work, study, or relax.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/c22a21902f37672b7810cc1962a8903b.poster.avif?t=1752759542\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/c22a21902f37672b7810cc1962a8903b.webm?t=1752759542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/c22a21902f37672b7810cc1962a8903b.mp4?t=1752759542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Twitch &amp; Streaming integration</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect to your stream and turn your stream into cozy cafe where chat join  cafe and hangout as customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/d85c9ff652971b4eb21d97c175a898c9.poster.avif?t=1752759542\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/d85c9ff652971b4eb21d97c175a898c9.webm?t=1752759542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/d85c9ff652971b4eb21d97c175a898c9.mp4?t=1752759542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock and upgrade more than 300 recipes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook and serve delicious drinks and dishes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/02fb8bc35e3a6c51c5c0da6f068fb5be.poster.avif?t=1752759542\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/02fb8bc35e3a6c51c5c0da6f068fb5be.apng?t=1752759542\" class=\"bb_img\" width=576 height=324 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Connect with your friends online with Postal Service</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send gifts to your friends. Visit your best friends' cafe.</p>",
